    <string name="episode_how">How this scam works</string>
    <string name="episode_how_body">1. Small “rewards” arrive from strangers for liking videos or simple tasks.\n2. You are asked to pay to “unlock” your earnings or reach the next level.\n3. Each payment is bigger than the last, often to a different account.\n4. Then they disappear with the money. Your earnings were never real.</string>
